<title>LATVIA: SAULES SEES OLAINFARM PRICE BELOW ONE LAT.</title>
<headline>SAULES SEES OLAINFARM PRICE BELOW ONE LAT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saules Bank on Monday said it expected the initial price of Olainfarm on the bourse to be between 0.70 santimes and one lat.</p>
<p>Olainfarm, a pharmaceutical company, is being quoted on the bourse's secondary list today.</p>
<p>&quot;No big rush (to buy its shares) could be expected, however,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Olainfarm shares are not very attractive to investors due to poor financial data,&quot; the statement added.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
